00:28:23,000 --> 00:28:24,533
然后在那边有一家
ránhòu zài nàbiān yǒu yì jiā
And another over there

654
00:28:24,533 --> 00:28:27,633
所以现在我们要准备回家了
suǒyǐ xiànzài wǒmen yào zhǔnbèi huí jiā le
So we’re getting ready to head home

655
00:28:27,633 --> 00:28:29,033
现在风变大了
xiànzài fēng biàn dà le
The wind is stronger now

656
00:28:29,033 --> 00:28:32,600
现在是快到傍晚了
xiànzài shì kuài dào bàngwǎn le
It’s almost evening now

657
00:28:32,600 --> 00:28:34,700
傍晚就是太阳快要落山了
bàngwǎn jiùshì tàiyáng kuài yào luòshān le
Evening is when the sun is about to set

658
00:28:34,700 --> 00:28:35,900
所以在海边
suǒyǐ zài hǎibiān
So by the sea

659
00:28:36,066 --> 00:28:38,133
一般到傍晚的时候呢
yìbān dào bàngwǎn de shíhou ne
Usually in the evening

660
00:28:38,466 --> 00:28:40,200
风会变得很大
fēng huì biàn de hěn dà
The wind gets quite strong

661
00:28:40,266 --> 00:28:42,500
然后温度也会变低
ránhòu wēndù yě huì biàn dī
And the temperature drops

662
00:28:42,500 --> 00:28:44,300
就是会变得有点冷
jiùshì huì biàn de yǒudiǎn lěng
So it gets a little cold

663
00:28:44,833 --> 00:28:46,833
所以我们要准备回家了
suǒyǐ wǒmen yào zhǔnbèi huíjiā le
So we’re getting ready to go home

664
00:28:46,900 --> 00:28:49,733
我们就下次再见吧
wǒmen jiù xiàcì zàijiàn ba
We’ll see you next time

665
00:28:49,733 --> 00:28:51,100
byebye
byebye
Bye bye!

